  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: WI-totub filed as gating precondition (small clap::Parser experiment to determine whether 'rust-analyzer scip' default invocation surfaces proc-macro-expanded symbols at all). The proc-macro question was originally posed in WI-mirus-pupas (closed wont_do 2026-05-17, stale premise from before the silent-fall-through finding). Until WI-totub runs, the expected value of this item for wasm_bindgen.py / napi.py / tauri_ipc.py specifically is unknown — those three linkers' value depends entirely on whether SCIP carries the macro expansion. The other Rust-touching linkers in scope (jni.py for JNIEXPORT, cgo.py for cgo) are unaffected because their joins don't depend on proc-macros."  # fa6c
